<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-HAMBURG WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HAMBURG WOMEN'S SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG, Germany 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the $450,000 Hamburg women's tennis tournament on Saturday (prefix number denotes seeding): 7-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Anne Gaelle Sidot (France) 6-4, 6-0  </p>
<p>4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Maria Sanchez-Lorenzo (Spain)  6-2, 6-3</p>
</text>
